      "category": "IMPLICIT_TRANSITION",
      "subject": "session",
      "stage": "rtsp_fsm",
      "description": "A PLAY request while the stream is still in the Play state is legal and can be issued without an intervening PAUSE request. Such a request MUST replace the current PLAY action with the new one requested, i.e., being handled in the same way as if the request was received in Ready state.",
